; =============================================================================
; ZTC Ballistics — outfit / helmet ballistic rating (ztc_br_class)
; =============================================================================
; Ballistics script reads ztc_br_class (integer 0-6) on outfit and helmet
; item sections. Vanilla armor_class on bone protection sections does NOT exist.
;
; effective_br = ztc_br_class x 0.06 x item:condition()
;
; Scale:
;   0 = no ballistic rating (bandana, bare head)
;   1 = rags / trenchcoat / novice
;   2 = light stalker / bandit jacket
;   3 = medium / PS5 / sunrise / SEVA
;   4 = military / specops / bulat / berill
;   5 = Skat / SSP / scientific heavy / proto-exo
;   6 = Nosorog / full exoskeleton
;
; Mapped from bones_koeff_protection via actor_armor_classN (N+1) or named
; actor_armor_* / actor_helm_* tables in damages.ltx.
; Engine immunities and hit_fraction are NOT modified here.
; =============================================================================

